# Whitelist. Everything is ignored unless explicitly allowed below.
*

!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.R

# Data and genomes are not committed. This repository records how results
# were produced; the results themselves remain on the cluster.
*.fa
*.fna
*.faa
*.gz
*.tsv
*.csv
*.nwk
*.gff
*.png

# Final manuscript figures are committed as PDF, in figures/ only.
*.pdf
!figures/*.pdf
